from pathlib import Path
import collections,html,json
R=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
load=lambda n:json.loads((R/n).read_text(encoding='utf-8'))
e=html.escape
def table(h,rows):return '<div class="scroll"><table><tr>'+''.join('<th>'+e(x)+'</th>' for x in h)+'</tr>'+''.join('<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+e(str(x))+'</td>' for x in r)+'</tr>' for r in rows)+'</table></div>'
if not (R/'QUALIFICATION.json').exists():
 q=load('EXECUTION-FAILURE.json');body='<h1>Stage1 execution failed</h1><p>Frozen attempt preserved. Manuscript scoring CLOSED.</p><pre>'+e(json.dumps(q,indent=2))+'</pre>'
else:
 q=load('QUALIFICATION.json');rr=[x for x in q['records'] if 'panel_index' in x];positive=[x for x in rr if x['fixture']=='positive32'];plan=load('CONTROL-PLAN.json');support=load('SUPPORT-PLAN.json')
 body='<p>VOYNICH · v103 FULL-FAMILY CONTROL RUNNER · v104</p><h1>Qualification controls, before manuscript power</h1><p class="notice"><strong>'+e(q['status'])+'</strong>. Manuscript scoring remains CLOSED. Actual-layout power has NOT RUN. A control pass does not open the source-scoring lock; all v103 actual-layout power and three-bank gates remain required.</p>'
 body+='<p>The runner, exact fixture arrays, matrices, seeds, sample counts, family manifests and failure gates were frozen before outcomes. Original v103 and earlier failed methods remain unchanged. All 4005/4371/9730/9316 pair columns, both signs, both middle definitions and ×28 correction are retained. H/F and hands stay separate.</p>'
 body+='<h2>Full-family authored positive</h2>'+table(['Section','Hand','Reading','View','Pair columns','Adjusted target p','Forward','Detection gate'],[[x['section'],x['hand'],x['reading'],x['view'],x['columns'],f"{x['positive_adjusted_p'][0]/x['positive_adjusted_p'][1]:.6f}",x['positive_forward'],x['positive_pass']] for x in positive])
 body+='<p>This is a deliberately planted 32-span authored arrangement. It is an engineering positive, not a measured manuscript effect, an empirical power estimate, or proof of the 80%/90% requirements.</p>'
 body+='<h2>Exact controls and sampler audit</h2><p>Small complete literal orbits checked every family column against independent direct word comparisons and exact DP marginals. Homogeneous independent/page/line/hand first-order nuisance weights must be constant within each constrained fiber. Exact family rank bounds include the .05/28 tail; tiny orbits can be incapable of rejection and are not claimed powered. Separate constant and barrier fixtures remain visible.</p>'
 body+=table(['Check','Receipt'],[[x.get('check',''),x['pass_gate']] for x in q['records'] if 'check' in x]+[['Complete panel/view/fixture records',len(rr)],['Union-bound CDF support-point budget',support['full_family_support_points']],['4096-draw absolute CDF error limit',f"{support['absolute_CDF_error_limit']:.6f}"],['Required control failures',len(q['failed_required'])]])
 body+='<h2>Mechanism-scope diagnostics: preserve every flag</h2><p>These generators are outside the uniform conditional null: position-dependent ordering, repeated literal templates and literal junction preferences. Their residual signals are not false positives under the stated null and cannot be labelled grammar. They use the same full-family calibration and correction.</p>'
 body+=table(['Section','Hand','Reading','View','Generator','Target flags /200','Any-family flags /200','Exact target rejection probability'],[[x['section'],x['hand'],x['reading'],x['view'],d['regime'],d['target_flags'],d['family_flags'],f"{d['exact_target_rejection_mass'][0]/d['exact_target_rejection_mass'][1]:.4f}"] for x in positive for d in x['scope_diagnostics']])
 body+='<details><summary>Every control, including constant/sparse and failed cases</summary>'+table(['Panel','Reading','Hand','Fixture','View','Columns','Maximum CDF error','Literal CDF error','Oracle layouts','Estimability','Gate'],[[x['panel_index'],x['reading'],x['hand'],x['fixture'],x['view'],x['columns'],f"{x['max_marginal_CDF_error']:.6f}",f"{x['literal_orbit_CDF_error']:.6f}",x.get('oracle_layouts','large authored'),x.get('estimability','planted positive'),x['pass_gate']] for x in rr])+'</details>'
 body+='<h2>What remains closed</h2><p>No original manuscript token arrays or order were loaded by this control runner. The family manifest contains historical class definitions only. Exact source-layout marginal calculations, CDF qualification, the unchanged per-view ≥80% at r1.5 and ≥90% at r2 power gates, and all three new-method banks have not run. v98 remains FAIL; its old banks2/3 remain unrun. This is retrospective method qualification under finite authored controls, not fresh manuscript confirmation or arbitrary strong FWER proof.</p><p>The runner exposes no actual-manuscript scoring command. A required failure stays failed; any repair needs a separately frozen named attempt. Independent panels finish rather than being dropped.</p>'
 body+='<p><a href="FREEZE.json">Pre-outcome code/input hashes</a> · <a href="CONTROL-PLAN.json">Exact controls and gates</a> · <a href="FIXTURES.json">All authored arrays</a> · <a href="FAMILY.json">Unreduced family manifests</a> · <a href="SUPPORT-PLAN.json">Pre-sampling CDF budget</a> · <a href="QUALIFICATION.json">Every outcome</a> · <a href="VERIFICATION.json">Replay verification</a> · <a href="../retrospective-order-design-v103/report.html">Original v103 design</a></p><p>Browser appearance unreviewed; source/numerical verification is separate.</p>'
style='<style>body{max-width:1350px;margin:auto;padding:28px;background:#f5f2e9;color:#203f35;font:16px/1.55 system-ui}h1{font-size:32px}h2{margin-top:30px}.notice{background:#e0e9d8;padding:16px}.scroll{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{padding:9px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #bac9bb}a{color:inherit}</style>'
(R/'report.html').write_text('<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>v103 full-family qualification controls · v104</title>'+style+'<main>'+body+'</main></html>',encoding='utf-8')
print(q['status'])
